    "updated_at": "2016-09-02T15:58:43Z",
    "body": "I wonder if we should work on PRs to UI events to fix those two bugs you mention, @foolip? They are long-standing and pervasive problems with UI events that have caused a lot of confusion throughout the ecosystem. (Also https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/95 and https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/90 maybe...)\n\nCurious what the editors of UI events think.\n",
