    "created_at": "2016-10-12T13:24:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-12T13:24:41Z",
    "body": "So some testing shows `<label>` does indeed look at the target of the event (and elements between the target and itself). `<input type=image>` also needs the coordinates of the event. So passing the event itself to \"activation behavior\" seems like the way to go.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
